===Etymology===
From {{inh|apw|ath-pro|*-ǯəγe·ʔ}}. Cognates: {{cog|nv|-jaa’}}, {{cog|apm|-jaa}}, {{cog|apj|-jaa}}, {{cog|apk|-jaghe}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[d͡ʒàː]|lang=apw}}

===Noun===
{{head|apw|noun|head=-jaa|[[inalienable]]}}

# {{lb|apw|anatomy}} [[ear]], outer ear
#: {{ux|apw|shijaa|inline=1|my ear}}
#: {{ux|apw|bijaa|inline=1|her/his/their ear}}

====Usage notes====
The form '''-jaa''' occurs in the San Carlos varieties; '''-jaa’''' occurs in White Mountain and Dilzhe’eh ([[Tonto]]).

